config BR2_PACKAGE_LIBRETRO_RUFFLE
	bool "libretro-ruffle"
	depends on BR2_aarch64
	help
	  Flash games: Ruffle (ruffle.rs, MIT/Apache-2.0) as the libretro
	  core RG DS Play loads for .swf movies and Flashpoint game packs,
	  /usr/lib/libretro/ruffle_libretro.so. Built from this
	  repository's play/ruffle by tools/build_ruffle.py on the build
	  machine (Buildroot's Rust is too old for Ruffle 0.8.0); this
	  package installs the result. Draws with GLES through Mesa's EGL.
